      "text": "SMUGGLING ATTEMPT STOPPED AT SEA!\n\nOn 4/30, USBP agents and the U.S. Coast Guard intercepted a 15-foot boat carrying 13 illegal aliens near Otay Mesa, CA. After the vessel crossed the maritime boundary line, authorities stopped it in open waters and escorted it to shore. Agents determined that none of the individuals had immigration documents allowing legal entry into the U.S. The two smugglers—both Mexican nationals—now face prosecution for felony alien smuggling (8 USC 1324).",
