      "text": "On 5/8, USBP agents in Mt. Vernon, WA, arrested Isabel Valencia-Ramos, a Mexican national illegally present in the U.S. Valencia-Ramos has prior convictions for possession of a controlled substance, assault, and harassment. He was previously removed from the U.S. in 2017 following those convictions.\n\nAgents located him residing unlawfully in Skagit County, WA. He now faces federal prosecution for felony illegal re-entry (8 USC 1326) and will be removed to his home country.",
