      "text": "On 5/6, an 18-year-old fled a USBP checkpoint in Las Cruces, NM, after agents referred him to secondary inspection due to a strong odor of marijuana. He ignored commands and sped off—but agents caught him shortly after.\n\nInside his vehicle, agents found:\n▪️ 9mm handgun\n▪️ .40 caliber ammo\n▪️ Marijuana cigars\n▪️ Drug paraphernalia with cocaine residue\n\nHe now faces charges for high-speed flight under 18 USC 758.\n\nDisregarding a federal checkpoint and endangering the public won’t be tolerated. Offenders will be held accountable.",
      "text_resolved": "On 5/6, an 18-year-old fled a USBP checkpoint in Las Cruces, NM, after agents referred him to secondary inspection due to a strong odor of marijuana. He ignored commands and sped off—but agents caught him shortly after.\n\nInside his vehicle, agents found:\n▪️ 9mm handgun\n▪️ .40 caliber ammo\n▪️ Marijuana cigars\n▪️ Drug paraphernalia with cocaine residue\n\nHe now faces charges for high-speed flight under 18 USC 758.\n\nDisregarding a federal checkpoint and endangering the public won’t be tolerated. Offenders will be held accountable.",
